/P 94 0 R
/E (The Smart Expense Splitter and Group Budget Management System is a web-based application developed to simplify the management of shared expenses among friends, roommates, families, and project teams. The system enables users to create groups, record expenses, track budgets, and manage settlements efficiently. By automating calculations and providing financial insights, the application reduces manual effort and improves transparency in group financial management.)
