/E (Managing shared expenses manually becomes difficult when multiple people contribute different amounts toward group activities. Traditional methods such as spreadsheets or calculators are prone to calculation errors and make it difficult to track payments and budgets. Existing expense-splitting applications mainly focus on recording expenses and dividing bills but provide limited support for budget forecasting, spending analysis, and intelligent financial recommendations.)
