164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (The Smart Expense Splitter and Group Budget Management System was successfully implemented using a full-stack architecture. The frontend provides an interactive dashboard where users can create groups, add members, record expenses, and monitor budgets. The backend processes requests, validates user input, performs calculations, and communicates with the database. Features such as automatic expense splitting, balance calculation, budget tracking, settlement generation, and spending analytics were successfully integrated. Testing demonstrated that the system accurately calculates individual shares, updates balances in real time, and generates meaningful financial insights. The developed prototype effectively meets the objectives of simplifying expense management and improving financial transparency.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
