/T (The project can be further enhanced by integrating advanced technologies and additional features to improve user experience and functionality. Future improvements may include AI-powered financial recommendations that help users optimize spending habits, OCR-based receipt scanning for automatic expense entry, and voice-based expense recording for greater convenience. Mobile application support can increase accessibility, while multi-currency management and payment gateway integration can make the system suitable for international and real-world financial scenarios. Advanced analytics and predictive models can also be incorporated to provide more accurate budgeting insights and spending forecasts.)
